</div>                <div n="2" type="jArticle">                   <head>                      <hi rendition="#b">Slovenen-Demon&#x017F;trationen.</hi>                   </head>                   <lb/>
<dateline>                      <hi rendition="#b">Laibach,</hi> 20. Februar.</dateline>                    <p>Ge&#x017F;tern Abends und<lb/>
